OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWarm sunny spells throughout
OL,6,Fthe day and remaining dry for most.
OL,7,FThe southwesterly wind strengthens for
OL,8,Fa time during the afternoon.
OL,9,FTemperatures remaining slightly above
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry start to the evening
OL,13,Fbecoming cloudy with a band of rain
OL,14,Fpushing eastwards from midnight and
OL,15,Facross most parts by the morning.
OL,16,FRemaining breezy especially along the
OL,17,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
