OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA cloudy day with rain, heavy
OL,6,Fat times in the north of the region
OL,7,Fand lighter and more intermittent in
OL,8,Fthe south. A strong and often blustery
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly wind prevails.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fperiods with isolated showers on
OL,13,FSaturday, lighter winds. Often cloudy
OL,14,FSunday but dry. Cloudy with isolated
OL,15,Fshowers on Monday. Temperatures near
OL,16,For slightly above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
